  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop SX 300 2025 is a performance-focused spin racquet featuring a 100 sq.in head, 300 g unstrung weight and 320 mm slightly head-light balance. SONIC CORE with Infinergy improves rebound, vibration absorption and comfort, while SPIN BOOST XT GROMMETS and SPIN BOOST FRAME GEOMETRY enhance spin, power and shot consistency. V-ENERGY SHAFT increases stability and swing speed, while VIBROSHIELD reduces unwanted vibration. It is designed for intermediate to advanced players seeking a balanced combination of spin, explosive power and control.",

    "zh": "Dunlop SX 300 2025 是 SX 系列的核心旋转型球拍，采用100平方英寸拍面、300克空拍重量及320毫米略偏头轻平衡设计。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提升回弹表现、减震能力与舒适性；SPIN BOOST XT GROMMETS 与 SPIN BOOST FRAME GEOMETRY 强化旋转、力量及击球稳定性；V-ENERGY SHAFT 提升拍框稳定性与挥拍速度；VIBROSHIELD 则进一步降低不必要的震动。整体定位为旋转、力量与控制均衡，适合中级至高级的现代底线及全场型球员。"
  },

